SUMMARY:Parkinson's Foundation Walk Volunteer Event
LOCATION:Sign in to download the location
DESCRIPTION:Come join AMA in supporting the Parkinson’s Foundation at their annual Moving Day event on Sunday\, October 4th in Lincoln Park!\n\nWe will help assist along the walk route\, helping direct and support participants throughout the event. We will likely need volunteers from approximately 8:00 AM–12:00 PM.\n\nCome out\, get involved\, and support a great cause with your fellow AMA members!\n\nWe will send out an email closer to the event date with exact details! \n---\nEvent Details: https://mwustudentlife.midwestern.edu/rsvp?id=377150
