BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:7zGyO69AL7XAEzhcUo0p@ccom-dashboard
SUMMARY:Donation Drive for Phoenix Children's
LOCATION:Sign in to download the location
DESCRIPTION:Join the Physical Medicine and Rehabilitation (PM&R) Club in supporting the inpatient rehabilitation unit at Phoenix Children’s Hospital! We are hosting a donation drive to collect brand-new creative supplies\, coloring books\, activity books\, toys\, and fine-motor engagement tools for pediatric patients undergoing rehabilitation.\nInpatient pediatric rehab involves extensive recovery milestones\, physical therapy\, and downtime. These items provide vital creative outlets\, help reduce procedural anxiety\, and assist pediatric patients in rebuilding fine motor skills and hand-eye coordination during their recovery journey.\n---\nEvent Details: https://mwustudentlife.midwestern.edu/rsvp?id=377780
DTSTART:20261005T140000Z
DTEND:20261019T230000Z
END:VEVENT
