SUMMARY:PM&R Keen Sports Volunteering
LOCATION:Sign in to download the location
DESCRIPTION:The PM&R Club at CCOM is partnering with KEEN Chicago (Kids Enjoy Exercise Now) — a nonprofit that provides free\, non-competitive fitness and recreation programs for children and young adults with disabilities.\n\nEach volunteer will be paired up with at least one KEEN athlete (i.e.\, child participant) and guide them through the duration of the event. This is a great opportunity to gain exposure to adaptive sports for students who want to go into PM&R\, pediatrics\, sports medicine\, or anyone who'd like to work with children with special needs!\n\nPlease complete this short form to help us coordinate volunteers for the event.\n\nhttps://forms.gle/mZYfX9ZWGmEBrDiM7\n---\nEvent Details: https://mwustudentlife.midwestern.edu/rsvp?id=377793
