UID:GGc199saZK5AQYlS2MFA@ccom-dashboard
SUMMARY:Walk to End Alzheimer's
LOCATION:Wesley Bolin Memorial Plaza\, 1700 W Washington Street Phoenix\, AZ 85007
DESCRIPTION:The Walk to End Alzheimer's is an annual event that takes place across the country to raise awareness and money for Alzheimer's. This year the walk in Phoenix is on Saturday\, November 7th. Check in begins at 7:30am\, ceremony starts at 8:40am\, walk starts at 9:00am\, and the event ends at 11:00am. The location is Wesley Bolin Memorial Plaza\, 1700 W Washington Street Phoenix\, AZ 85007. It is a free event to participate in\, the walk has a 1.5 mile route and 2.5 mile walk. Fundraising is optional but encouraged. \n---\nEvent Details: https://mwustudentlife.midwestern.edu/rsvp?id=377403
DTSTART:20261107T143000Z
DTEND:20261107T180000Z
